{"4185830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RE//POSSESSED", "steam_appid": 4185830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/19d3074e70867d3c0df94994167e991e.avif?t=1787931820\" alt=\"REPOSSESSED Logo.\" width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help C fight for her freedom!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world was brought to its knees by an alien attack. When all hope was lost, the attackers vanished without a trace. Leaving the now ravaged earth with new found, enigmatic technology. From those ashes rose Mega-Corporations indulging in this new found power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world you play as C, 32 years young, waking up in front of the city gates, with only one thing on her mind: <strong>Revenge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/cf3c6afaf808c64dbe00908e542869bb.avif?t=1787931820\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras_big/cf3c6afaf808c64dbe00908e542869bb.webp?t=1787931820 width=1560 height=296 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gun-play RE//imagined!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique control scheme of RE//POSSESSED allows you to freely position your weapon (or items) on the screen in 180 degrees of rotational freedom. This dynamic aim system allows you to aim around corners, throw items from unexpected angles and to control the battlefield without ever being seen or noticed. Fight your way up the corporate ladder one or several heads at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/7007e826828ed7c1b0d48985dd023789.poster.avif?t=1787931820\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=850 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/7007e826828ed7c1b0d48985dd023789.webm?t=1787931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The immersive-sim Mindset!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True to the immersive-sim philosophy it is up to you to find <strong>your</strong> own way to complete the assigned missions. We just provide you the tools for the job. Become a juggernaut and go in (or out) with guns blazing. Be the very shadow that haunts the city at night and never been seen or noticed at all. Or become a monster right out of a sleazy stalker horror movie. The tools are within your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In true Eurojank Fashion.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you want. Balance C's augments, maximize your output and break <strong>the very game</strong>. However keep in mind: Every combat advantage will have an equal drawback. Are you up to the task?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Further Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully dynamic physics system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-Save and Quick-Load system embraced by design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An dynamic inventory system usable at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great Soundtrack made by static.grl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Artworks made by Pandaru/Vestar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/a0d2a1c7499e1dffc6e999da6bf35b1e.avif?t=1787931820\" width=1560 height=1350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made with Open-Source tools, by <strong>human </strong>hands and a SteamOS/Linux first approach.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made from the ground up in Godot, using the Jolt physics engine, with models and environments made in Blockbench.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/19d3074e70867d3c0df94994167e991e.avif?t=1787931820\" alt=\"REPOSSESSED Logo.\" width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help C fight for her freedom!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world was brought to its knees by an alien attack. When all hope was lost, the attackers vanished without a trace. Leaving the now ravaged earth with new found, enigmatic technology. From those ashes rose Mega-Corporations indulging in this new found power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world you play as C, 32 years young, waking up in front of the city gates, with only one thing on her mind: <strong>Revenge</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/cf3c6afaf808c64dbe00908e542869bb.avif?t=1787931820\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras_big/cf3c6afaf808c64dbe00908e542869bb.webp?t=1787931820 width=1560 height=296 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gun-play RE//imagined!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique control scheme of RE//POSSESSED allows you to freely position your weapon (or items) on the screen in 180 degrees of rotational freedom. This dynamic aim system allows you to aim around corners, throw items from unexpected angles and to control the battlefield without ever being seen or noticed. Fight your way up the corporate ladder one or several heads at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/7007e826828ed7c1b0d48985dd023789.poster.avif?t=1787931820\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=850 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/7007e826828ed7c1b0d48985dd023789.webm?t=1787931820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The immersive-sim Mindset!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True to the immersive-sim philosophy it is up to you to find <strong>your</strong> own way to complete the assigned missions. We just provide you the tools for the job. Become a juggernaut and go in (or out) with guns blazing. Be the very shadow that haunts the city at night and never been seen or noticed at all. Or become a monster right out of a sleazy stalker horror movie. The tools are within your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In true Eurojank Fashion.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you want. Balance C's augments, maximize your output and break <strong>the very game</strong>. However keep in mind: Every combat advantage will have an equal drawback. Are you up to the task?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Further Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully dynamic physics system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-Save and Quick-Load system embraced by design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An dynamic inventory system usable at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great Soundtrack made by static.grl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Artworks made by Pandaru/Vestar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/extras/a0d2a1c7499e1dffc6e999da6bf35b1e.avif?t=1787931820\" width=1560 height=1350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made with Open-Source tools, by <strong>human </strong>hands and a SteamOS/Linux first approach.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made from the ground up in Godot, using the Jolt physics engine, with models and environments made in Blockbench.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "RE//POSSESSED is a uniquely controlled cyberpunk immersive sim set in a post-space war Germany. You play as C, being either a shadow in disguise, a killing murder machine or unpredictable flying monster that neither knows personal boundaries nor accepts the concept of walls or fences.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/c71cde2d0e306a94cc4dd4e6def09dd83cf8a406/header.jpg?t=1787931820", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/4a3f695ee22faf848e2c0a48782b4bf7ab88796e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787931820", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185830/4a3f695ee22faf848e2c0a48782b4bf7ab88796e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787931820", "website": "https://repossessed.moe/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-4790, AMD Ryzen 5 3400G <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050/60, AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Anything as powerful or better as the Steam Deck will work (The GPU must support Vulkan 1.2 or newer!).</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400, AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070/80, AMD RX 5700XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Any halfway decent CPU after 2016 should work. A good CPU is more important than a good GPU.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04.6 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-4790, AMD Ryzen 5 3400G <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050/60, AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Anything as powerful or better as the Steam Deck will work (The GPU must support Vulkan 1.2 or newer!).</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04.6 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400, AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070/80, AMD RX 5700XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Any halfway decent CPU after 2016 should work. A good CPU is more important than a good GPU.</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["CatWithCode"], "publishers": ["CatWithCode"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "d